# Copy to .env.local for development (git-ignored).
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the JavaScript bundle at BUILD time — it is not
# read when the page runs. So this must be set in whatever environment runs
# `next build`, not on the server that hosts the result, and changing it means
# rebuilding. `next build` refuses outright when it is unset (next.config.ts).
#
# Development: the API on localhost.
# Production:  the API's public origin, e.g. https://warroom-api.fly.dev
#
# Whatever is set here must also appear in the API's CORS_ORIGINS — from the
# other side. The browser blocks the response otherwise, and reports it as a
# generic network failure that never mentions CORS.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
